    "Add episodes from a podcast feed. Edit mode lets you drag to reorder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add episodes from a podcast feed. Edit mode lets you drag to reorder."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge Episoden aus einem Podcast-Feed hinzu. Im Bearbeitungsmodus kannst du per Ziehen neu anordnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add podcast": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add podcast"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podcast hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to queue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to queue"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zur Warteschlange hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After %lld newly marked-played episodes (manual or finished playback), AntennaPod may ask iOS to show a rating sheet once per install. iOS decides whether to show it and may suppress the dialog under system limits — we never spam.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After %lld newly marked-played episodes (manual or finished playback), AntennaPod may ask iOS to show a rating sheet once per install. iOS decides whether to show it and may suppress the dialog under system limits — we never spam."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach %lld neu als gehört markierten Episoden (manuell oder nach Ende) kann AntennaPod iOS einmal pro Installation um eine Bewertung bitten. iOS entscheidet, ob der Dialog erscheint, und kann ihn unter Systemlimits unterdrücken — wir spammen nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each feed refresh (Inbox pull-to-refresh, Keep updated, or a single podcast refresh), enqueues up to %lld newest unplayed episode(s) per feed. Override per podcast via Feed detail → gear. Always/Never beat this global toggle. Cellular gating is under Network / Downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each feed refresh (Inbox pull-to-refresh, Keep updated, or a single podcast refresh), enqueues up to %lld newest unplayed episode(s) per feed. Override per podcast via Feed detail → gear. Always/Never beat this global toggle. Cellular gating is under Network / Downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach jeder Feed-Aktualisierung (Pull-to-Refresh im Posteingang, Aktualisiert halten oder einzelner Podcast) werden bis zu %lld neueste ungehörte Episode(n) pro Feed eingeordnet. Pro Podcast unter Feed → Zahnrad überschreibbar. Immer/Nie schlagen diesen globalen Schalter. Mobilfunk-Sperre unter Netzwerk / Downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After refresh, newly appeared episodes are enqueued on Queue and downloaded (respects Auto-download Wi‑Fi only). Separate Auto-download rules still apply to newest unplayed caps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After refresh, newly appeared episodes are enqueued on Queue and downloaded (respects Auto-download Wi‑Fi only). Separate Auto-download rules still apply to newest unplayed caps."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach der Aktualisierung werden neu erschienene Episoden in die Warteschlange gestellt und heruntergeladen (achtet auf Auto-Download nur Wi‑Fi). Separate Auto-Download-Regeln gelten weiter für die Neueste-ungehört-Obergrenze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After refresh, newly appeared episodes are enqueued on Queue. Inbox still shows them while unplayed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After refresh, newly appeared episodes are enqueued on Queue. Inbox still shows them while unplayed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach der Aktualisierung werden neu erschienene Episoden in die Warteschlange gestellt. Der Posteingang zeigt sie weiterhin, solange sie ungehört sind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
