    "Apple Watch (beta lite): Continue listening shows episode title + podcast from the same snapshot as the homescreen widget (phone pushes via Watch Connectivity; App Group id group.de.danoeh.antennapod.ios). Play / Open on iPhone remotes antennapod://play on the companion. No independent Watch playback, downloads, or queue — when audio is already playing, use system Now Playing on the Watch. Requires AntennaPodWatch target, Dev Team, and App Group on Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Watch (beta lite): Continue listening shows episode title + podcast from the same snapshot as the homescreen widget (phone pushes via Watch Connectivity; App Group id group.de.danoeh.antennapod.ios). Play / Open on iPhone remotes antennapod://play on the companion. No independent Watch playback, downloads, or queue — when audio is already playing, use system Now Playing on the Watch. Requires AntennaPodWatch target, Dev Team, and App Group on Mac."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Watch (Beta lite): Weiterhören zeigt Episodentitel + Podcast aus demselben Snapshot wie das Homescreen-Widget (iPhone pusht per Watch Connectivity; App Group group.de.danoeh.antennapod.ios). Play / Auf iPhone öffnen steuert antennapod://play auf dem Companion. Keine eigenständige Watch-Wiedergabe, Downloads oder Warteschlange — bei laufender Wiedergabe System-Now-Playing auf der Watch nutzen. Braucht AntennaPodWatch-Target, Dev Team und App Group auf dem Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
