    "Beta iOS JSON backup (Application Support maps + Settings + gpodder prefs). Not AntennaPod Android DB. Optional offline media via the toggle (ZIP folder downloads/ ↔ Documents/downloads). gpodder password and Podcast Index keys stay in Keychain and are omitted from the ZIP. For a printable subscription list, use Import / Export → Export subscriptions as HTML.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beta iOS JSON backup (Application Support maps + Settings + gpodder prefs). Not AntennaPod Android DB. Optional offline media via the toggle (ZIP folder downloads/ ↔ Documents/downloads). gpodder password and Podcast Index keys stay in Keychain and are omitted from the ZIP. For a printable subscription list, use Import / Export → Export subscriptions as HTML."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beta-iOS-JSON-Backup (Application-Support-Maps + Einstellungen + gpodder-Prefs). Keine AntennaPod-Android-DB. Optionale Offline-Medien per Schalter (ZIP-Ordner downloads/ ↔ Documents/downloads). gpodder-Passwort und Podcast-Index-Schlüssel bleiben im Keychain und fehlen in der ZIP. Für eine druckbare Aboliste: Import / Export → Abonnements als HTML exportieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
