    "Nextcloud Gpodder Sync (beta MVP): same subscription limits as gpodder.net — additive pull/push of feed URLs; remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds; episode actions not synced. Enter your Nextcloud base (server root or full API root like https://cloud.example.com/index.php/apps/gpoddersync/). Uses HTTP Basic (app password recommended). Requires the Gpodder Sync app on the server. Device id is kept for UI/state only (Nextcloud has no device API).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nextcloud Gpodder Sync (beta MVP): same subscription limits as gpodder.net — additive pull/push of feed URLs; remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds; episode actions not synced. Enter your Nextcloud base (server root or full API root like https://cloud.example.com/index.php/apps/gpoddersync/). Uses HTTP Basic (app password recommended). Requires the Gpodder Sync app on the server. Device id is kept for UI/state only (Nextcloud has no device API)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nextcloud Gpodder Sync (Beta-MVP): gleiche Abonnement-Grenzen wie gpodder.net — additives Pull/Push von Feed-URLs; Remote-Entfernungen deabonnieren lokal nicht; Episodenaktionen nicht synchronisiert. Nextcloud-Basis eingeben (Server-Root oder voller API-Root wie https://cloud.example.com/index.php/apps/gpoddersync/). HTTP Basic (App-Passwort empfohlen). Braucht die Gpodder-Sync-App auf dem Server. Geräte-ID nur für UI/Status (Nextcloud hat keine Geräte-API)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
