    "Optimize for speech via the iOS `AVAudioSession` mode (`.spokenAudio`, or `.voiceChat` fallback). When off, audio uses `.default` and video (surface shown) uses `.moviePlayback`. This is a **session mode**, not Android's LoudnessEnhancer gain curve. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optimize for speech via the iOS `AVAudioSession` mode (`.spokenAudio`, or `.voiceChat` fallback). When off, audio uses `.default` and video (surface shown) uses `.moviePlayback`. This is a **session mode**, not Android's LoudnessEnhancer gain curve. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sprachanpassung über den iOS-`AVAudioSession`-Modus (`.spokenAudio`, Fallback `.voiceChat`). Aus: Audio nutzt `.default`, Video (sichtbare Fläche) `.moviePlayback`. Das ist ein **Session-Modus**, keine Android-LoudnessEnhancer-Kurve. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
