    "Uses NWPathMonitor (Wi‑Fi / Ethernet vs cellular). Auto-download Wi‑Fi only defaults on — skips enqueue on cellular. Manual download Wi‑Fi only (default off) refuses user downloads on cellular and records an error. Stream Wi‑Fi only (default off) blocks network stream URLs on cellular; local offline files still play. Turn a toggle off to allow cellular for that action.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses NWPathMonitor (Wi‑Fi / Ethernet vs cellular). Auto-download Wi‑Fi only defaults on — skips enqueue on cellular. Manual download Wi‑Fi only (default off) refuses user downloads on cellular and records an error. Stream Wi‑Fi only (default off) blocks network stream URLs on cellular; local offline files still play. Turn a toggle off to allow cellular for that action."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nutzt NWPathMonitor (Wi‑Fi / Ethernet vs. Mobilfunk). Auto-Download nur Wi‑Fi standardmäßig an — überspringt Mobilfunk. Manueller Download nur Wi‑Fi (Standard aus) lehnt Downloads im Mobilfunk ab und speichert einen Fehler. Stream nur Wi‑Fi (Standard aus) blockiert Stream-URLs im Mobilfunk; lokale Offline-Dateien spielen weiter. Schalter aus = Mobilfunk für diese Aktion erlaubt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video player": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video player"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Videoplayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an episode is marked played (manual or when playback finishes), its offline file is deleted via DownloadService. The episode row and played status stay. Skips while that local file is still the active player item, and skips favorited / starred episodes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an episode is marked played (manual or when playback finishes), its offline file is deleted via DownloadService. The episode row and played status stay. Skips while that local file is still the active player item, and skips favorited / starred episodes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn eine Episode als gehört markiert wird (manuell oder nach Wiedergabeende), wird die Offline-Datei über DownloadService gelöscht. Zeile und Gehört-Status bleiben. Ausgesetzt, solange die lokale Datei noch aktiv im Player ist, und bei Favoriten/Sternen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, after a feed refresh the newest unplayed episodes (not already downloaded) are enqueued via DownloadService, capped per feed. Per-podcast Always/Never overrides are on each feed’s settings sheet. Storage-limit eviction still applies. Wi‑Fi-only for auto-download is under Network / Downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, after a feed refresh the newest unplayed episodes (not already downloaded) are enqueued via DownloadService, capped per feed. Per-podcast Always/Never overrides are on each feed’s settings sheet. Storage-limit eviction still applies. Wi‑Fi-only for auto-download is under Network / Downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, werden nach einer Feed-Aktualisierung die neuesten ungehörten Episoden (noch nicht heruntergeladen) über DownloadService eingeordnet, begrenzt pro Feed. Pro-Podcast Immer/Nie unter Feed-Einstellungen. Speicherlimit-Bereinigung gilt weiterhin. Nur-Wi‑Fi für Auto-Download unter Netzwerk / Downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, offline files are removed after an episode is marked played. Episode metadata and played status are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, offline files are removed after an episode is marked played. Episode metadata and played status are kept."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, werden Offline-Dateien entfernt, nachdem eine Episode als gehört markiert wurde. Metadaten und Gehört-Status bleiben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled: new episodes after refresh, download failures, and/or gpodder/Nextcloud login or sync failures. Local only — no push.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled: new episodes after refresh, download failures, and/or gpodder/Nextcloud login or sync failures. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv: neue Episoden nach Aktualisierung, Download-Fehler und/oder gpodder-/Nextcloud-Login- oder Sync-Fehler. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, disables the idle timer while playback is actively playing so the screen stays awake. Restored when paused, stopped, or no episode. Default off (battery-friendly). Does not override Low Power Mode beyond the idle timer; no brightness changes; Picture in Picture and background audio are unchanged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, disables the idle timer while playback is actively playing so the screen stays awake. Restored when paused, stopped, or no episode. Default off (battery-friendly). Does not override Low Power Mode beyond the idle timer; no brightness changes; Picture in Picture and background audio are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, deaktiviert den Idle-Timer während aktiver Wiedergabe, damit der Bildschirm wach bleibt. Wiederhergestellt bei Pause, Stopp oder ohne Episode. Standard aus (akkufreundlich). Überschreibt den Energiesparmodus nur beim Idle-Timer; keine Helligkeitsänderung; PiP und Hintergrund-Audio unverändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next item from the Queue. When off, episode end still marks played / saves progress but does not advance. End-of-episode sleep timer always stops without advancing. Default on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next item from the Queue. When off, episode end still marks played / saves progress but does not advance. End-of-episode sleep timer always stops without advancing. Default on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, startet nach Ende einer Episode automatisch die nächste aus der Warteschlange. Wenn aus, wird die Episode weiterhin als gehört markiert / Fortschritt gespeichert, aber nicht weitergeschaltet. Der Sleep-Timer „Ende der Episode“ stoppt weiterhin ohne Weiterleitung. Standard an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, video episodes (MIME video/* or mp4/m4v/mov/webm) show artwork in the full player instead of a video surface. Lockscreen / Now Playing stays audio either way. Picture-in-picture is not included in this beta. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, video episodes (MIME video/* or mp4/m4v/mov/webm) show artwork in the full player instead of a video surface. Lockscreen / Now Playing stays audio either way. Picture-in-picture is not included in this beta. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, zeigen Video-Episoden (MIME video/* oder mp4/m4v/mov/webm) im Vollbild-Player Cover statt Videofläche. Sperrbildschirm/Now Playing bleibt Audio. Picture-in-Picture ist in dieser Beta nicht enthalten. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When over the limit, played downloads are deleted first (oldest file first), then unplayed (LRU by file date). Runs after each successful download, when opening Settings, and on launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When over the limit, played downloads are deleted first (oldest file first), then unplayed (LRU by file date). Runs after each successful download, when opening Settings, and on launch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Über dem Limit werden zuerst gehörte Downloads gelöscht (älteste Datei zuerst), dann ungehörte (LRU nach Dateidatum). Läuft nach jedem erfolgreichen Download, beim Öffnen der Einstellungen und beim Start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you open the app (launch or return to foreground), all subscriptions refresh if this interval has elapsed. Applies globally to every feed. Background App Refresh is stubbed until Info.plist adds fetch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you open the app (launch or return to foreground), all subscriptions refresh if this interval has elapsed. Applies globally to every feed. Background App Refresh is stubbed until Info.plist adds fetch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Öffnen der App (Start oder Rückkehr in den Vordergrund) aktualisieren sich alle Abonnements, wenn dieses Intervall abgelaufen ist. Gilt global für jeden Feed. Background App Refresh ist stubbed, bis Info.plist Fetch ergänzt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
